{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1323.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"434fa4d40256d85b8ff3db2d5d2909d13e95dfb7d31dc3bf8cbbf56d31b32090","ja":"え～っと、これでいいのかな～？　\nやっほ～！　みんな、わたしの声、聞こえてるー？","zh":"嗯～这样就可以了吗～？　\n哈喽～！大家能听到我的声音吗～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1323.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"9aa206746f6268c5c936adecbba264d2301aa6269d05fa04bbb805c2a6e25c7f","ja":"翼さん、スマホを持って\n何をしているんですか？","zh":"翼，你拿着手机\n在做什么呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1323.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"18397c6daf9cccc04f5362792d20c984fe114f842a9c5d2cff86d74452add358","ja":"生配信だよ！　……あっ、星梨花ちゃんの声に\nすっごい反応してる！　それじゃあ、始めるよー♪","zh":"开始直播啦！……啊，它对星梨花的声音\n反应超大！那么，这就开始啰～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1323.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"0df430e390a75c0ea907f6eda0128fc1b387b37ac20341098e11bc00064d0a67","ja":"みんな、初配信を見に来てくれて、ありがと～！\n早速だけど、発表したいことがありま～す！","zh":"大家，谢谢你们来看我的首次直播～！\n闲话少说，我有件事情要宣布哦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1323.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"15c572e52ef86dc437bfcf5a0ed48570a334d2a6f30a9b5fc75279bd7ab9ab18","ja":"わたし、伊吹翼は今日から期間限定で配信者として\n活動することが決まっちゃいました～♪","zh":"我，伊吹翼决定从今天起\n限期作为主播展开活动啦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1323.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"2784409237b1ce891e8ed1aca1dd0f34505114e232a7903fed69a549b26418c8","ja":"映画の宣伝もバッチリしながら\n楽しい配信を目指すので、応援お願いしま～す♪","zh":"电影的宣传也会好好兼顾，\n目标是做出一场开心的直播，还请大家多多支持哦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1323.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"a6c7ca0188d09d23783f73d78e38512d52d64bb3aad10433be30a442322a36db","ja":"今日は、楽屋のみんなの過ごし方を見せちゃおう\nかな～……。え～っと、まずは誰から……。","zh":"今天就来给大家看看后台大家都是怎么度过的\n吧～……嗯～，首先从谁开始呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1323.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"a0c6bf913e0c9c6a8750e709c9d6d4c39e43237a0ec4572071aa7b7f8b37c00d","ja":"ぱんぱかぱーん！　みんな、見てる～？\n麗花だよ～！　わーいわーい♪","zh":"啪啪啪啪——！大家，有在看吗～？\n我是丽花哦～！哇～咿哇～咿♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1323.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"5cf23ae9cff4775d28d4d879aa36767097569c7f6f7bead684de55415a0f8c44","ja":"わっ、麗花さん！　いきなり出てきたら見てる\nみんなも、びっくりして……って、喜んでる！？","zh":"哇，丽花小姐！突然跑出来的话，看着的\n大家也会吓一跳……诶，反而很高兴！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1323.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"c7298b0aaca77a06b329883bd5aa3240c7801c7b3981aff9df4e1045e6fe65b9","ja":"ふふっ、コメントがいっぱい来てるね♪\nあゆあゆもほら、ぱんぱかぱーんって！","zh":"呵呵，有好多评论送过来了呢♪\n阿步阿步你也快看，啪啪啪啦砰——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1323.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"3c05289f3a40ef10c16e9d4bdedfe833c2ec1c9ecc0e07f2e024fccaa6ddc946","ja":"ええっ、ぱんぱかぱーん？　……って、\nみんなの前で恥ずかしいことさせるなよ！","zh":"咦，砰砰啪啪——？　……我说，\n别让我在大家面前做这么丢人的事啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1323.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"6ad3d9f565c1613ab286dd7a4b3556dfef0c4a733ccf966bd75a8da1bdd1f52c","ja":"歩さんの登場にもたっくさんコメントが来てますよ♪\nこの調子で、盛り上がっていきましょ～！","zh":"关于步的登场也有好多留言哦♪\n就保持这个势头，一起嗨起来吧～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
